Fork point: e484bd3a84ea5cc22800a8f7067d9984b7ccc7ea (2026-10-02)

The ConnectBot source is committed here, under connectbot/, as a squashed git
subtree of the commit above — upstream's tree, without upstream's history. That
squash commit records the fork point in its own `git-subtree-split` trailer, so
the two cannot drift apart.

Per section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0, the notice that we changed
files is the set of commits that touch connectbot/, each of which names the
upstream file it modifies and shows the change. Every modified region also
carries a short "Changed for Tab Atelier Remote" comment in the code itself, so
the notice survives being read out of context. To see the complete change set:

    base=$(git log -1 --grep='git-subtree-split:' \
        --format='%(trailers:key=git-subtree-split,valueonly)')
    git diff "$base" -- connectbot/

Neither the name "ConnectBot" nor any upstream contributor's name is used to
endorse this fork. Section 6 of the Apache License, Version 2.0 grants no
trademark rights, so this application is presented under its own name,
"Tab Atelier Remote".

